WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.834
-And finally,
have you guys noticed that

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.133
when you start typing something
on Google,

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:05.767
it automatically tries to
complete the search for you?

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:08.133
It autofills
what you're looking for.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.901
Sometimes their suggestions
are a little off.

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:10.934
I'm gonna show you what I mean.

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:12.434
It's time for
"Google Autofails."

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:13.868
Here, check this out.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:18.334
-♪ Google Autofails, yeah ♪

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:20.567
Here's an example
that I typed in.

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:22.567
I said,
"Which country should I..."

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:23.701
These three things pop up.

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:25.501
"...visit for Spring Break?"

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:26.901
"...check out in Europe?"

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:29.000
"...move to after the U.S.
bans TikTok?"

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.000
These are autofills.
-Autofails!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.133
Here's another one.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.667
I typed in,
"Why did Tucker Carlson..."

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.367
It said,
"...get his own show?"

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:38.901
"...get the January 6th tapes?"

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.300
"...describe 'Creed III'
as 'mostly peaceful'?"

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:46.000
Next up, I typed in,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.934
"Are the contestants on
'The Masked Singer"..."

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:49.767
It said, "...really singing?"

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.267
"...getting paid?"

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.634
"volunteers or prisoners?"

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:56.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:59.167
Next up, I typed in,
"Can H&amp;R Block..."

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:01.033
It said, "...do my taxes?"

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:02.467
"...answer my questions?"

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.334
"...take a shoebox full
of loose documents

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:05.601
and make sure I don't
go to prison?"

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.968
"Look at this. Help me."

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.634
And finally, I typed in,
"I feel out of control when..."

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:14.501
It said, "...I party too much."

00:01:14.501 --> 00:01:15.968
"...I have too much work."

00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:18.000
"...the steering wheel
on my Tesla falls off."

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.968
That's it for
"Google Autofails"!

